# ===== 必需（协作规范依赖，已有 .gitignore 时只补这一段缺的行）=====
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.log
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.db
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/worktrees/
CLAUDE.local.md

